<item>
<title>Ethiopia: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/ethiopia/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-ethiopia-2026-10-13T07:53:43.104Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 13 Oct 2026 07:53:43 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Ethiopian forces have entered the Tigray towns of Adwa and Adigrat, moving close to the Eritrean border, while Eritrean soldiers have crossed into Ethiopian territory and been targeted by Ethiopian drones that struck Eritrean troops supporting Tigrayan rebels. Both sides have appealed to the UN for deterrence or intervention, with Ethiopia framing its actions as self-defence against Eritrean incursions. The conflict caused 2,824 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiWEFVX3lxTE1ON3JlRVNFa0FNbS05YUFhM2VTaFNDLUJHRTQybDViUmtCMzNvZEVIXzY5R2FOTTF6LXZoSHVxUTlZZi1tSUF3UkdfY2RRT0pCLUY3cXhxOXU?oc=5&quot;&gt;AFP Fact Check&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixAFBVV95cUxOa3otdUpMV081a0ZSLTRCeHRwM2ZRV05qYi1nUHgtSHpjMnVPU2FXUV9jZ0JCYjFsTC1xN2lBUzNGTE9JeFNUMmlpV01pcnNkejk2TFdSMkp2WURRRWhNZloyRVRaTEYzamRTNXUwTV80ZkhoUE9OR1gwYWJVMUpwemhuMkVZT2dYLVF5NVUwSnJWNngtRFhJcDFHWkxjNmlDSDZEUlJ4R0hSQTBtN2JXb2s3MmUyaFBMSlJmNHc1WGdJVXEt?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
</item>
